  "short_description": "在那座積木山的下面某處，埋著你的地板。用磁力手套、篩盤和追蹤零件的視覺，分揀這座不可能的「大堆」。裝滿貼好標籤的抽屜，取出零件，看著 MOC 一磚一瓦地咬合成型。愜意、滿足，只受一條規則支配：永遠不要按顏色分揀。",
  "short_description_en": "Somewhere under that mountain of bricks is your floor. Sort the impossible Pile with a magnet glove, sieves, and part-seeking vision. Fill labeled drawers, pull parts, watch MOC builds snap together brick by brick. Cozy, satisfying, and governed by one rule: never sort by color.",
